From 4e813e78ca1084a2b2b3dddcbc2af093fa5ee4d2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Oussama Benjelloun <benje.oussama@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 4 Sep 2026 14:25:02 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/7] HIP: build with the LLVM AMDGPU target and lld

Re-adds AMDGPU as an optional Halide_LLVM component (dropped in #8382),
links lldELF/lldCommon when available (same policy as WebAssembly),
initializes the AMDGPU target/asm parser/asm printer, registers the hip,
windows_hip and amdgpu_dev runtime modules, and instantiates the AMDGPU
device codegen from the GPU offload pass.

Co-authored-by: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
